{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36852","headline":"霅溪晚泊寄裴庶子 · 罗隐","name":"霅溪晚泊寄裴庶子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪风如扇雨如丝，闲步闲吟柳恽诗。\n杯酒疎狂非曩日，野花狼藉似当时。\n道穷谩有依刘感，才急应无借寇期。\n满眼云山莫相笑，与君俱是受深知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}